Package: qretools
Title: Tools for Creating and Documenting Questionnaires
Version: 0.0.1.001
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Bader", email = "michaeldmbader@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6292-7790"))
Description: Provides tools for the lifecycle of survey research, including
    questionnaire development, documentation, survey wave management, and
    dissemination. Builds questionnaires from question banks and value-label
    sets, applies types, value labels, and missing-value codes to collected
    data, and produces data summaries and codebooks.
